        },
        {
          "text": " ahakuba omukono gwa MUKAMA guryaguma ahari oru rushozi, kandi Moabu eryaribatiiririrwa omu mwanya gwayo, nk'oku baribatiirira embuba omu kiina ky'amasha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
