              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi Moabu eryanagiramu emikono, nk'oku orikuziha anaga emikono naaziha; kwonka MUKAMA aryamucwa amaryo, amumaremu obuhangu bw'engaro ze, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.25.11",
