          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " kandi ebigo bye by'eminaara ebyombekirwe aha ngo z'amabaare ez'endembo ze, aryabisheenya, abihigure, abikumbagaze ahansi, bihikire kimwe omu mucuucu.",
